The rules in references/command.md are a snapshot of
https://github.com/vercel-labs/web-interface-guidelines
commit 434b7f91364665f2f733b310ec54809bf8f37937 (command.md).
That repository ships the MIT licence below.

The skill wrapper (SKILL.md) is a snapshot of skills/web-design-guidelines
from https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills at commit
5a37a6329fbad3666c3207392a6a7c0110e92efb. That repository did not ship a
LICENSE file, and the skill frontmatter does not declare one. The rules
file is the MIT snapshot.

